   "widgets_values_named": {
    "prompt": "Turn the animated character in <image1> into a real person, photographed in real life. It must look like an ordinary unedited smartphone photo taken by a friend: phone main camera in auto mode, available natural light, slight sensor noise, mild phone HDR and sharpening, most of the scene in focus, neutral white balance and slightly flat everyday phone colors (not golden, not cinematic, no color grading), no retouching, no beauty filter, no studio lighting.\nReal human anatomy and proportions: real skin with visible pores, fine hairs, small blemishes, freckles and uneven tone; normal-sized human eyes with real irises, wet highlights and real eyelashes; real hair with individual strands, flyaways and natural shine.\nReal materials: actual fabric with visible weave, seams, stitching, folds and wrinkles; real lace, real metal, real glass with true reflections and smudges. Fantasy elements such as wings, horns, ears or magic become real physical props or practical effects (for example thin iridescent film wings).\nKeep exactly the same pose, body position, hand and finger positions, head tilt, facial expression, gaze direction, camera angle, framing and crop, outfit design, colors and details, hairstyle, accessories, and every background object in the same place as in <image1>. Do not add, remove or redesign anything.",
